Package: canreport
Title: Generate Cancer Registry Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Qiong", "Chen", email = "chenq08@126.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(
             ORCID = "0000-0003-2401-0046",
             affiliation = "Department of Cancer Epidemiology, The Affiliated Cancer Hospital of Zhengzhou University & Henan Cancer Hospital, Henan Cancer Registry in China"
           ))
Description: Provides tools for generating narrative reports from
    Population-Based Cancer Registry (PBCR) analysis outputs, including cancer
    incidence, mortality, ranking, age-specific patterns, and subgroup
    comparisons by sex, area, and urban-rural strata. It supports standardized
    CanReg-style reporting workflows and helps produce reproducible,
    consistent, and bilingual cancer registry report text from structured
    statistical results.
